5
00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:23.006
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: A modern
CPU processes instructions by fetching,

6
00:00:23.006 --> 00:00:29.562
decoding, and executing them in a pipeline,
while classic architectures like the Von

7
00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:33.093
Neumann model separate instruction and data
