15
00:01:07.569 --> 00:01:12.241
NARRATOR: Store instructions transfer register
data to memory.

16
00:01:12.241 --> 00:01:20.797
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: In
RISC-V, integer registers x1 through x31 hold

17
00:01:20.797 --> 00:01:28.694
