25
00:02:07.562 --> 00:02:13.591
NARRATOR: With the foundation in place,
examine how Instruction Set and Operation

26
00:02:13.591 --> 00:02:16.605
Codes operates in a concrete sequence.

27
00:02:16.605 --> 00:02:23.301
NARRATOR: The RISC-V ISA defines
programmer-visible instructions, registers,

28
00:02:23.301 --> 00:02:29.996
