39
00:03:25.384 --> 00:03:31.084
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case:
Conditional branches redirect execution to

40
00:03:31.084 --> 00:03:37.354
different memory addresses when specific
register values meet a condition, enabling

41
00:03:37.354 --> 00:03:39.634
